{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0214_1000_p", "source_sha256": "eb15e89aaf5b3b7996622decbcf1360c08fb2aa8fcc4cae4b6643bde2e111e4d", "ja": "（ファンタジー映画の魔法使い役に、可奈が大抜擢！\nしかし、役柄を掴むのは簡単ではなさそうだ……）", "zh": "（可奈在奇幻电影中被破格选为魔法师一角！不过，要把握好这个角色似乎并不容易……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0214_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "50dc150d68755c775b5fcd28ea86bb5efbf72516ce66f9930e4721e39419a936", "ja": "うぅ……今回の役も、難しいなぁ……。ツンツン？\n意地悪？　厳しい？　どう演じたらいいんだろ～？", "zh": "呜呜……这次的角色也好难啊……带刺？\n使坏？严厉？到底该怎么演呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0214_1002_p", "source_sha256": "26084ef177d5e2108d40667f68b6e293a23e77ad81b1597400ca715a42abc128", "ja": "お疲れさま、可奈。\n悩んでるみたいだな。", "zh": "辛苦了，可奈。\n你好像正在烦恼啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0214_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "a0920a3493b9f6e31ac2698e41997af6284cfd3e999b71e2ad9ff70e39e78ba6", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん……！　なんだか\nうまくいかなくて～♪　待ってました、助け舟～♪", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生……！总觉得进展得不太顺利～♪ 救星终于来了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0214_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c388dada78c1e82fae1c2ec40a27dca379602ee5b0f969b89cbbe98b636f1740", "ja": "可奈の役柄は……真面目で強気な魔法使いだな。\nでも性格のきつい子なら、前にもやったよな？", "zh": "可奈的角色是……认真而且好强的魔法使吧。\n不过性格强势的女孩，之前不也演过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0214_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "e34e368a2cac68a4a849eb54572e4d242c23b5385bdf9b96abe02d50caae2d24", "ja": "はい！　スターエレメンツの時に……\n水桜も、裏表があって難しい役でした！", "zh": "是的！在演出《STAR ELEMENTS》的时候……\n水桜也是个表里不一、很难演的角色！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0214_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "02c565b85a3c6055cca8cb4407e24d2c353fa7972c575ea3dfb87194b9b1414b", "ja": "今回も、ちょっと似てるかもって思ったんですけど。\nでもなんだか、違う気もして……。", "zh": "这次我也觉得，或许有点像。\n不过总觉得，好像又不太一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0214_1007_p", "source_sha256": "39e524d0da68a0735db0c63b967a39ab178c6bb6d7827b989239003fad40c81c", "ja": "そうだな、表面的な態度は似ていても、違う\n人物だしな……もっと身近な人を参考にしたらどうだ？", "zh": "是啊，表面上的态度虽然相似，但毕竟是不同的人物……要不要参考一下身边更熟悉的人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0214_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "09f76f912b2f7639954746cd58f38266acccbfb20d4872aedd68944f71d57ac3", "ja": "身近な人、ですか？　うーん、うーん……。\n私の近くにこういう人、いるかな～……。", "zh": "身边的人吗？嗯——嗯——……我身边有这种人吗～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0214_1009_036kan", "source_sha256": "742d0df483c52f190e83e92211484a03ae6ac3d9804d38d1730d9d6d802f340f", "ja": "志保ちゃん、ちょっと似てるかも……？　とっても\n真面目だし……その、よく怒るところも……。", "zh": "志保，可能有点像……？她非常认真……还有，那个，总是很容易生气这一点也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0214_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b6b11ce7d04fafa23a9c98b87dbe9fac8ef094ae3cade116d8f81ece5105cdac", "ja": "そうだな……それに志保もだけど、たとえ口調が\n厳しくても、怒ってるだけじゃないと思わないか？", "zh": "是啊……而且志保也是，哪怕说话语气很严厉，也不只是因为在生气，你不觉得吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0214_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "8ebb28fa9bb61bb21f1feac64e81cce5a69d5368fd121805d3d02bba74645f5a", "ja": "きつい言い方なのに、怒ってるわけじゃなくて……？\n志保ちゃんみたいな……あっ！　そっか！", "zh": "明明说话那么冲，却不是在生气……？像志保那样……啊！我明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0214_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "35df8dc308eb24a4766e2a5ed97db600985d03b3f700164710df26dd15bfe387", "ja": "{$P$}さん、私、どうすればいいか\nわかったかもです！　えへへ……♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我好像\n知道该怎么做了！诶嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_036kan0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_036kan0214_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "2f5a1ac28039f2116ee3b0e479c6e3ef8900f3811f547148c187c70d8b5e72fd", "ja": "よ～し、休憩終わったらがんばるぞ～♪", "zh": "好～，休息结束之后我要加油啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
